[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さて……まずは胞子の発生源を見つけたいわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright... first things first, let's find where the spores are coming from."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……恐らく、向こうの方角",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Most likely, that direction."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かるの、ヤド姉？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You can tell, Jadwiga?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は常人より肌が敏感。胞子の流れを探知できる。\nより肌が露出した服であれば、さらに鋭敏に探知が可能",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My skin is more sensitive than a normal person's. I can detect the flow of spores. With less clothing covering my skin, detection would be even more precise."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いやいや。それ以上薄くするのは粋じゃないね。\n今ぐらいの攻め具合でいいさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nah, stripping down any further wouldn't be very chic. The current level of daring is just right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれぇ、いいの、イェルカ？\nヤドヴィガに好きな服を着せる機会だよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? You sure about that, Jelka? This could be your chance to dress Jadwiga however you like."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前さんって奴は……冗談ばかり言ってないで、\nちゃんと周りに気を払いな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You never quit, do you... Less joking around, more staying alert."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あははっ、みんなで一緒に行動するの、\nなんだか楽しいな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe... It's kind of nice, all of us moving together like this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でしょ？\u3000兄弟は仲良くあるべきよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right? Siblings should stick together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……それは、同意",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Agreed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヘルトとゼロも仲良くしてくれればいいのに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If only Held and Zero could get along too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういう次元じゃないんだよ、あの二人は",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those two are operating on a completely different level."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……注意。胞子の濃度が上がった。\nこの先に、発生源がある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Warning. Spore concentration is rising. The source is just ahead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当かい？\u3000ん、あれは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For real? Hmm, that's..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おいおい……キノコ型の魔物が大量に。\nあいつらが元凶ってわけかい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, you've got to be kidding... A whole swarm of mushroom monsters. So they're the ones behind all this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "間違いないね。あれだけ胞子を撒かれたら、\n普通の人間はひとたまりもないさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No doubt about it. With that many spores being scattered, any ordinary person wouldn't stand a chance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたたち、準備はいい？\u3000\nここで引き返すわけにはいかないわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone ready? Because turning back is not an option."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、私、やるよ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... I'm ready...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "戦闘態勢、移行。全力で殲滅する",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Entering combat mode. Eliminate all targets."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし、みんなで一気に片付けよう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's take them all down at once!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]